; THE TRAY IS AN OBJECT, NOT A ROOM. Its camera, sun and world environment moved to table.tscn in
; B0, where one fixed camera now has to frame the board as well. That means this scene ON ITS OWN
; renders black and unlit, which is correct: open res://table.tscn to play with the tray. The
; fairness sweep still runs the real tray, through the table, and never needed a camera.


